  "GEPA arms (B, D): truth, judge and FPR computed per seed (ratio of sums over items) and averaged over the 3 seeds; in each bootstrap resample items are drawn with replacement (shared across arms, paired) and B's and D's 3 seeds are each redrawn with replacement independently, averaging the per-seed resampled ratios over the drawn seeds.",
